{
  "schema_version": 3,
  "policy": "All reusable benchmark assets required by a new run are tracked directly under benchmark/template. New runs must not read prior run directories. Reuse applies only to source/harness/fixture assets; every run rebuilds, executes, validates, and remeasures them. Quidra program sources are never reused across target commits. Git object SHA-1 values are derived mechanically from the evaluated repository HEAD during init and frozen into reuse/materialized.json; they are not duplicated manually in this catalog.",
